From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KmsFbLock <kmsfblock@local>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:05:00 
Subject: [PATCH 0122] gpu31-kms: log the fbdev restore_mode bracket (int77, module-only)

exynos7580_fbdev_start_scanout() logs mutex_locked/acquire_ctx before and after
drm_fbdev_cma_restore_mode(), so a lock left held by the fbdev modeset is
visible in the trace next to the built-in lock_all/unlock_all logs.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/exynos7580/exynos_drm7580_fbdev.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/exynos7580/exynos_drm7580_fbdev.c
@@ -135,7 +135,11 @@
 
 	fb = list_first_entry(&drm->mode_config.fb_list, struct drm_framebuffer, head);
 
+	pr_info("exynos7580_fbdev: restore_mode enter (mutex_locked=%d acquire_ctx=%p)\n",
+		mutex_is_locked(&drm->mode_config.mutex), drm->mode_config.acquire_ctx);
 	drm_fbdev_cma_restore_mode(fbdev);
+	pr_info("exynos7580_fbdev: restore_mode exit (mutex_locked=%d acquire_ctx=%p)\n",
+		mutex_is_locked(&drm->mode_config.mutex), drm->mode_config.acquire_ctx);
 
 	info = exynos7580_fb0(ex);
 	if (!info) {
